            { "gm.vramshield", new[]{ "显存驻留（实验）", "Video memory residency (experimental)" } },
            { "gm.vramshield.sub", new[]{ "显存吃紧时给游戏声明一份最低显存预留，减少纹理被挤出显存再调回造成的长帧。不增加也不锁定显存，充裕时不动作，退出对局撤销。实验功能，效果请自行开关各打一局对比。", "Declares a minimum video memory reservation for the game when VRAM runs tight, reducing long frames caused by textures being evicted and paged back. It neither adds nor locks memory, does nothing when VRAM is plentiful, and is revoked when the match ends. Experimental — compare matched on/off matches yourself." } },
            { "log.vramshield.1", new[]{ "显存驻留 本机只有核显 预留无意义 本局跳过", "VRAM residency: integrated graphics only, reservation is meaningless; skipped this match" } },
            { "log.vramshield.2", new[]{ "显存驻留 打不开游戏进程句柄 多半被反作弊挡住 本局跳过", "VRAM residency: cannot open the game process handle, most likely blocked by anti-cheat; skipped this match" } },
            { "log.vramshield.3", new[]{ "显存驻留 两块显卡都在跑 3D 分不清渲染显卡 本局跳过", "VRAM residency: 3D load on more than one GPU, render GPU is ambiguous; skipped this match" } },
            { "log.vramshield.4", new[]{ "显存驻留 打不开渲染显卡 本局跳过", "VRAM residency: cannot open the render GPU adapter; skipped this match" } },
            { "log.vramshield.5", new[]{ "显存驻留 预留被外力清除 本机不再尝试 关掉开关再打开可重试", "VRAM residency: the reservation was cleared externally; no further attempts on this machine. Toggle the switch to retry." } },
            { "log.vramshield.6", new[]{ "显存驻留 游戏自己已有 {0} GB 预留 不覆盖 本局跳过", "VRAM residency: the game already has a {0} GB reservation; not overriding, skipped this match" } },
            { "log.vramshield.7", new[]{ "显存驻留 可预留额度为零 本局跳过", "VRAM residency: no reservable headroom; skipped this match" } },
            { "log.vramshield.8", new[]{ "显存驻留 写入后回读为零 本机不采纳 已撤销并不再尝试", "VRAM residency: read back zero after writing, this machine does not honour it; reverted with no further attempts" } },
            { "log.vramshield.9", new[]{ "显存驻留 已声明 {0} GB 占用 {1} GB 预算 {2} GB 占比 {3}% 退局撤销", "VRAM residency: declared {0} GB. Usage {1} GB of {2} GB budget ({3}%). Revoked when the match ends." } },
