            { "t.systemauditverdicts.16", new[]{ "仅改善空闲后首次输入停顿，不改善稳态延迟。台式机可关闭；笔记本需权衡续航。", "Targets only first-input stalls after idle, not steady-state latency. Safe on desktops; weigh battery cost on laptops." } },
