            { "t.systemauditverdicts.55", new[]{ "关闭页面文件不提帧，只会让内存不足时直接崩溃；部分游戏和反作弊还依赖它。", "Disabling the page file does not raise FPS; it turns memory pressure into crashes, and some games and anti-cheat require it." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.56", new[]{ "可用托管方案解除", "Use the managed plan to lift it" } },
