            { "log.adlxtweaks.6", new[]{ "AMD Anti-Lag：检测到 Chill 处于开启状态，已快照，退出时一并还原", "AMD Anti-Lag: Chill detected on, snapshotted, will be restored together on exit" } },
            { "log.gpupowermax.6", new[]{ "显卡功耗墙 AMD 写入失败", "GPU power limit: AMD write failed" } },
            { "log.gpupowermax.8", new[]{ " 退出对局还原", " restored on match exit" } },
            { "rsr.warn", new[]{ "开启前请确认：本项以画质换取帧率。\n\n需在游戏内将分辨率下调一档（如原生的 77%）才会生效；画面整体变软，细节可能闪烁，1080p 屏幕上尤为明显。竞技类游戏追求帧率时可以开启，画质优先的游戏不建议。\n\n确认开启？", "Before enabling, note that this trades image quality for frame rate.\n\nIt only takes effect if the in-game resolution is set one step below native (for example 77% of native); the picture softens overall and details may shimmer, especially on 1080p displays. Reasonable for competitive titles chasing frame rate, not recommended for visually rich games.\n\nEnable it?" } },
            { "set.amd.none", new[]{ "未检测到 AMD 显卡驱动，本项停用", "No AMD GPU driver detected; this option is disabled" } },
            { "set.amdafmf", new[]{ "AMD 流体运动帧 驱动插帧", "AMD Fluid Motion Frames driver frame generation" } },
            { "set.amdafmf.n", new[]{ "驱动级插帧 AFMF，在两张真实画面之间推算一帧，帧率视觉上接近翻倍，不需要游戏支持。代价是输入延迟明显增加，实测竞技场景可能翻倍，对战游戏不要开启，适合单机大作追求观感。基础帧率低于 60 时瑕疵明显，建议配合可变刷新率屏幕。对 DX11、DX12、Vulkan 和 OpenGL 游戏生效。退出对局恢复原值。", "Driver-level frame generation (AFMF) interpolates one frame between two real frames, visually near-doubling the frame rate with no game support required. The cost is a clear increase in input latency — measured to potentially double in competitive scenarios. Do not enable it for PvP games; it suits big single-player titles that prioritize visual smoothness. Artifacts are obvious when the base frame rate is below 60; pairing with a variable-refresh-rate display is recommended. Works with DX11, DX12, Vulkan and OpenGL games. Restored to the original value when the match ends." } },
            { "set.amdalag", new[]{ "AMD Anti-Lag 低延迟", "AMD Anti-Lag low latency" } },
            { "set.amdalag.n", new[]{ "驱动调度层压缩 CPU 提前量，显卡满载时明显降低从操作到画面的延迟，AMD 官方数据最多降三成，显卡未跑满时收益趋零。对 DX9、DX11 和 DX12 游戏生效，纯驱动调度，不注入游戏代码，与反作弊无冲突；游戏内建 Anti-Lag 2 时以游戏内为准。与 Chill 互斥，开启时驱动会暂关 Chill，本软件已连同快照，退出对局一并还原；与「AMD 帧率上限」同开时限帧优先，本项让位。", "The driver's scheduling layer compresses the CPU's lead time, noticeably reducing input-to-display latency when the GPU is fully loaded — up to 30% by AMD's official numbers; the benefit approaches zero when the GPU is not maxed out. Works with DX9, DX11 and DX12 games. Pure driver scheduling, no code injected into the game, so no conflict with anti-cheat; when the game has built-in Anti-Lag 2, the in-game setting takes precedence. Mutually exclusive with Chill: the driver temporarily turns Chill off when this is on — Pavise snapshots it too and restores both when the match ends. When enabled together with \"AMD frame rate cap\", the frame cap takes priority and this option yields." } },
            { "set.rsr", new[]{ "RSR 驱动级升格", "RSR driver-level upscaling" } },
            { "set.rsr.n", new[]{ "Radeon Super Resolution：游戏内选低一档分辨率渲染，驱动放大回原生分辨率，几乎全游戏通用。这是拿画质换帧率的交易，画面会整体变软，1080p 屏幕损失明显。对局开始时开启，退出还原。", "Radeon Super Resolution: pick a resolution one step below native in-game and the driver upscales it back to native — works in almost every game. This trades image quality for frame rate: the picture softens overall, and the loss is noticeable on 1080p displays. Enabled at match start, restored on exit." } },
